      <species id="mwf13307ff_3972_402b_8a6a_a04c34865477" name="IL1" compartment="mw1e760d11_3315_4900_af1c_7ae713541c3d" initialConcentration="0" substanceUnits="MWDERIVEDUNIT_nanomolarity_milliliter" hasOnlySubstanceUnits="false" boundaryCondition="false" constant="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Interleukin-1alpha in tumor compartment. Tumor-derived; drives iCAF formation via NF-kB/LIF/JAK-STAT3. TGFb antagonizes signaling by downregulating IL-1R1.</body>
        </notes>
        <annotation>
          <SimBiology xmlns="http://www.mathworks.com">
