        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Tumor-local homeostatic Treg death (restored 2026-07-13). Bounds the pool so it can sit BELOW its half-saturation density; without it the renewal reaction is forced permanently negative and inverts. Shares the k_Treg_death deuterium anchor with the circulating compartments.</body>
