      <reaction id="mw4f310626_d78f_4113_b380_d7be5fa1d02c" name="Reaction_30" reversible="false">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Tumor-local Treg renewal, SATURATING in density (rho_Treg_max*V_T is the half-saturation density, NOT a hard ceiling). Reformulated 2026-07-13 from the unclamped logistic, which -- with the tumoral death removed on 2026-06-17 -- was forced permanently negative and ran as a quadratic sink (see the death reaction above and notes/model/tcell_carrying_capacity_inversion.md). This form is monotone in k_Treg_pro_tumor and in influx at every density, so the Cy throttle that gvax_module appends here (*(1 - Emax_Cy_Treg*...)) now correctly REMOVES Tregs instead of adding them. The pool is bounded by k_Treg_death (restored above), not by the cap. k_Treg_pro_tumor keeps its Ki67 submodel anchor. Mechanism-specific losses remain explicit: Cy depletion (gvax_module) and post-eradication clearance (below). The apCAF-driven additive cap (rho_Treg_apCAF_extra*H_apCAF) was retired 2026-05-01; an antigen-specific induced-Treg contribution (k_apCAF_iTreg, fibroblast_module_enhanced) remains the residual apCAF→Treg coupling.</body>
        </notes>
        <listOfProducts>
          <speciesReference species="mw9ce9af7d_9109_45df_a274_435a195e5d82" stoichiometry="1"/>
        </listOfProducts>
        <kineticLaw>
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <apply>
              <times/>
              <apply>
                <divide/>
                <apply>
                  <times/>
                  <ci> mw60a1b328_0080_452a_8218_6d2e5874397d </ci>
                  <ci> mw9ce9af7d_9109_45df_a274_435a195e5d82 </ci>
                </apply>
                <apply>
                  <plus/>
                  <cn type="integer"> 1 </cn>
                  <apply>
                    <divide/>
                    <ci> mw9ce9af7d_9109_45df_a274_435a195e5d82 </ci>
                    <apply>
                      <plus/>
                      <apply>
                        <times/>
                        <ci> mwd5399e99_aeb6_4674_b0b4_57b916943a73 </ci>
                        <ci> mw1e760d11_3315_4900_af1c_7ae713541c3d </ci>
                      </apply>
                      <ci> mwf23eace8_cda1_4ed0_bbcb_35db67ea7fbe </ci>
                    </apply>
                  </apply>
                </apply>
              </apply>
              <apply>
                <minus/>
                <cn type="integer"> 1 </cn>
                <apply>
                  <divide/>
                  <apply>
                    <times/>
                    <ci> mw58b8be05_5615_49b9_b26a_fb7300cf06b2 </ci>
                    <ci> mw88b5784a_a835_43f4_af21_20261acbda0f </ci>
                  </apply>
                  <apply>
                    <plus/>
                    <ci> mw88319c0f_43b1_4ef4_a7ce_d86afeb1f860 </ci>
